# The Eltima captures' own binary format.  The protocol work reads the .txt
# renders of the same two sessions (tools/verify_protocol.py), and those are
# tracked, so a clone can re-verify every PROTOCOL.md claim without the 5 MB of
# binary captures that only the Windows monitoring tool can open.
